id: screen-lock
section: Media and sound
item: The screen lock while a video plays (T-602, from the Atlas app): its button stands while the video plays; locked, a tap on the video does not reach it (the video plays on); a tap on the notice asks, a second unlocks, and a tap on the video pauses it again
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-media-test.html?src=clip60av.webm&wide=1
kit: cavekit-gre-widgets.md R1
wait rect v 20
calibrate 'sel:#status'
wait text status playing 15
# the daemon looks for a playing video once a second and the card shows the button on its notice
pause 2500
shoot lock-button
chrome lock-button
pause 800
shoot locked
# a tap on the video while locked: the shield takes it (no clickAt), the video plays on
dismiss 384 360
wait text status playing 3
dwell 2000
expect text status playing
# the notice timed out over the dwell: the unlock is the Atlas flow from a hidden notice — a tap shows "Screen
# locked", a tap on that asks "Unlock controls?", a second unlocks (three taps, within the notice's 3 s each)
chrome lock-notice
pause 600
chrome lock-notice
pause 600
shoot ask
chrome lock-notice
pause 600
shoot unlocked
tap v
wait text status paused 5
